# Project Standards

- Use **pnpm** only (`pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`, etc.)
- TypeScript strict; avoid `any` unless documented
- Minimize diff scope; match existing conventions
- Read `AGENTS.md` before Next.js API usage (Next 16 breaking changes)
- Conventional Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `chore:`
- Never commit secrets; use `.env.local`
